        case Chr{U32{WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WNil{}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}:
            Equal.cong(J.FastString, J.FastString, x => J.fast_push(x, c), J.fast_string(tail), J.Decoded{value}, evidence)
